<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink197-kilavi">
       talaimakaṉ iṭantalaippāṭṭiṉkaṇ talaiviyatu nilaimaikaṇṭu colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the hero, [he] having seen the state of the heroine at the [same] place [where their first union] took place.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink197">
<l>ilaṅkuvaḷai teḷirppa valava ṉāṭṭi</l>
<l>mukamputai katuppiṉa ḷiṟaiñciniṉ ṟōḷē</l>
<l>pulampukoṇ mālai maṟaiya</l>
<l>nalaṅkē ḻāka nalkuva ḷeṉakkē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Having chased crabs, so that her shining bangles sparkle,</l>
        <l>She stood, bent over, as one whose hair buried her face.</l>
        <l>As the lonely evening fades,</l>
        <l>She will grant me her good, lustrous breasts.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
